<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Online Complaint Registration Portals</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 30px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        h1, h2 {
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        .box {
            background: white;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Online Complaint Registration Portals for Colleges</h1>

<div class="box">
    <h2>UGC e-Samadhaan Portal</h2>
    <p>Used for complaints related to UGC regulation violations, faculty issues, and unfair practices.</p>
    <p><b>Helpline:</b> 1800-111-656</p>
</div>

<div class="box">
    <h2>National Consumer Helpline</h2>
    <p>Helps students report unfair fees and deficiency in educational services.</p>
    <p><b>Helpline:</b> 1800-114-000 / 14404</p>
</div>

<div class="box">
    <h2>Anti-Ragging Grievance Cell</h2>
    <p>For reporting ragging incidents in educational institutions.</p>
    <p><b>Helpline:</b> 1800-180-5522</p>
</div>

<div class="box">
    <h2>Conclusion</h2>
    <p>These portals help protect students' rights and ensure transparency.</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>